  "verdict": "The >= direction is FALSE AS STATED. Both factors have equal positive q-Gevrey order while the product has order 0, so order(a*b) < E(s,t) for any envelope positive on s,t > 0. Normalization-robust: whatever positive order the convention assigns a, it assigns the same to b. The fix is a HYPOTHESIS (non-cancellation on leading coefficients, or a positivity / field restriction), not a cleverer proof. The <= direction is unaffected.",
